---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Toile Blanche Contact | Suites & Restaurant | Toile Blanche"
  description=""
  ogImage="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/639af6c370637a9be3e3b0b0/63dbc14a7fa59e1233dd4d93_Neutral%20Beige%20Minimalist%20Photo%20Collage%20Facebook%20Cover%20(1).jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="both" />

  <div class="section bottom-padding-192 no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="hero4" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle">Contact</div><h1>Discrete luxury close to the glitter and glam of the French Riviera.</h1><div class="hero-arrow"><img alt="arrow down" class="hero-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-1e6e73d27d5690.svg" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)"/></div></div></div></div><div><div class="full-frame-image-wrapper contact"></div></div><div class="section padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-halves"><div class="main-content"><h2>Contact Info</h2><div class="contact-info"><a class="contact-link w-inline-block" href="null+33(0)4393327421"><div>+33 (0)4 93 32 74 21</div></a><a class="contact-link w-inline-block" href="nullinfo@toileblanche.com"><div>info@toileblanche.com</div></a><a class="contact-link w-inline-block" href="https://goo.gl/maps/VoKrme28X62qbvTk7" target="_blank"><div>826, chemin de la Pounchounière<br/>06570 Saint-Paul de Vence<br/>France</div></a></div></div><div class="secondary-content"><div class="w-form"><form data-name="Email Form" data-wf-element-id="16ef3489-8a5b-db78-7caf-154e32780aae" data-wf-page-id="63df93af2ae9b07ceed5822b" id="email-form" method="get" name="email-form"><div class="contact-input"><label for="name">Name</label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Name" id="name" maxlength="256" name="name" placeholder="John Doe" type="text"/></div><div class="contact-input"><label for="email">Email </label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Email" id="email" maxlength="256" name="email" placeholder="johndoe@youremail.com" required="" type="email"/></div><div class="contact-input"><label for="Message">Message</label><textarea class="form-message w-input" data-name="Message" id="message" maxlength="5000" name="Message" placeholder="I want to book a stay..."></textarea></div><input class="submit-button w-button" data-wait="Sending..." type="submit" value="Send Message"/></form><div class="w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. Try again soon.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper centered left-padding right-padding"><h3>A privileged location just a few minutes away from the legendary village of Saint-Paul-de-Vence.</h3></div><p class="paragraph-width-medium centered-paragraph">Ideally located in the heart of the French Riviera, Saint-Paul de Vence is situated only <br/>‍<br/>20 minutes from Nice International Airport, <br/>less than 30 minutes from Cannes<br/>40 minutes from Monaco<br/>a half hour from several golf courses<br/>Italy is only 45 minutes away. <br/><br/>In winter, the closest ski resorts, Isola 2000, Auron and Valberg, are a mere 90 minutes drive. <br/><br/>Other renowned locations, including Eze, Menton, Saint-Jean Cap Ferrat, Villefranche, Antibes, Biot or Mougins, are approximately 30 minutes by car.</p><div class="btn-wrapper center"><a class="button w-button" href="https://goo.gl/maps/ZCo7wYc9FkAkvSUH9" target="_blank">View in Google Maps</a></div><div class="divider _144px"></div></div></div><div class="divider _96px"></div><div class="section bg-color-2 hide"><div class="container"><div class="cta-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid cta-3-grid"><div class="cta-area-1" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af06-f049af02"><p>Get our emails. News about Toile Blanche, offers, special dishes from the chef’s table and much more. Not too often — Just enough.</p></div><div class="cta-area-2" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af09-f049af02"><h3>Don't be a stranger!</h3></div><div class="cta-area-3" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0c-f049af02"><div class="newsletter-form-block w-form"><form class="newsletter-form" data-name="Newsletter Form" data-wf-element-id="a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0e" data-wf-page-id="63df93af2ae9b07ceed5822b" id="wf-form-Newsletter-Form" method="get" name="wf-form-Newsletter-Form"><div class="newsletter-input"><label for="Full-Name">Name</label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Full Name" id="Full-Name" maxlength="256" name="Full-Name" placeholder="John Doe" required="" type="text"/></div><div class="newsletter-input"><label for="Email">Email Address</label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Email" id="Email" maxlength="256" name="Email" placeholder="john.doe@myemail.com" required="" type="email"/></div><input class="submit-button w-button" data-wait="Please wait..." type="submit" value="Try it out now!"/></form><div class="w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div><div class="small-text">*By subscribing to our newsletter you agree to our Privacy Policy</div></div></div></div></div></div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
